---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Terms and Conditions — Nexus Wave Technologies">
  <section class="hero legal-hero"><div class="container post-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>
    <p class="lead">These Terms explain how you may use the Nexus Wave Technologies website, product information, tools and related services.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container legal-shell"><nav class="legal-nav" aria-label="Legal pages"><a href="/legal/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/legal/terms" aria-current="page">Terms</a><a href="/legal/refund">Refunds</a><a href="/legal/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a><a href="/legal/accessibility">Accessibility</a></nav><article class="prose card legal-document">
    <h2>1. Agreement</h2>
    <p>By using this website or a feature that references these Terms, you agree to use the service lawfully, respectfully and in a way that does not put other users or the service at unnecessary risk.</p>

    <h2>2. The website and Nexus services</h2>
    <p>The website provides public information, posts, utilities, community information, Women Safety reporting and other service entry points. Some services may require a Nexus Plus account or another verified contact method.</p>

    <h2>3. Website use</h2><p>Use the website lawfully and do not attempt to disrupt, misuse, reverse engineer or bypass security controls. Do not impersonate another person or submit information you are not legally entitled to share.</p>

    <h2>4. Product and service descriptions</h2><p>Product descriptions, feature availability and pricing may change as services evolve. The information shown at the time of purchase governs the transaction, subject to applicable law and the published policies.</p>

    <h2>5. Paid services</h2><p>Where a service is paid, the checkout or purchase interface should identify the selected product or plan, price, currency and billing period where applicable. By confirming a purchase, you agree to the applicable purchase terms and Refund Policy.</p>

    <h2>6. Payment information</h2><p>Do not send passwords, OTPs or complete card credentials to Nexus Wave Technologies by email or through ordinary website forms. Payment information is handled through the configured payment provider.</p>

    <h2>7. AI and generated content</h2><p>AI-generated results may be incomplete or inaccurate. Review important output before relying on it, especially for legal, medical, financial or other high-stakes matters.</p>

    <h2>8. Third-party services</h2><p>Some services may rely on third-party providers such as hosting, database, AI or payment services. Their availability and terms may affect the service.</p>

    <h2>9. Refunds and cancellations</h2><p>Refunds and applicable cancellation handling are described in the Refund Policy. Customers may also have mandatory rights under applicable law.</p>

    <h2>10. Availability</h2><p>Features may be temporarily unavailable, changed or discontinued as reliability, security or product requirements evolve.</p>

    <h2>11. Changes and availability</h2>
    <p>Features may change, be temporarily disabled, or be redesigned as safety and reliability requirements evolve. We may update these Terms when material changes are made.</p>

    <h2>12. Limitation of service outcomes</h2><p>The availability of a website feature does not guarantee a particular legal, financial, medical or other outcome. Users remain responsible for decisions made using website information.</p>

    <h2>13. Contact</h2><p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@nexusweb.co.in">info@nexusweb.co.in</a></p>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: October 1, 2026.</p>
  </article></div></section>
<style is:global>
  .legal-hero{padding:72px 0 40px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--color-surface),var(--color-bg))}
  .legal-hero .lead{max-width:760px}
  .legal-shell{display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,1fr);gap:32px;align-items:start}
  .legal-nav{position:sticky;top:96px;display:grid;gap:6px;padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:16px;background:var(--color-surface)}
  .legal-nav a{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--color-text-muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:.92rem;font-weight:650}
  .legal-nav a:hover,.legal-nav a[aria-current=page]{background:var(--color-surface-soft);color:var(--color-text)}
  .legal-document{padding:32px}
  .legal-document h2{margin:34px 0 10px;font-size:1.35rem}
  .legal-document h2:first-child{margin-top:0}
  .legal-document p{margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.75}
  .legal-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:20px}
  .legal-meta span{padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:999px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  @media(max-width:850px){.legal-shell{grid-template-columns:1fr}.legal-nav{position:static;display:flex;overflow:auto}.legal-nav a{flex:0 0 auto}.legal-document{padding:24px}}
</style>
</Layout>